{
  "id": "cold_water_dwellings___storage_capacities",
  "title": "Cold Water Dwellings - Storage Capacities",
  "description": "Required cold water dwelling storage capacity - commonly used fixtures and types of buildings. Calculate 24-hour storage requirements based on fixtures and building types per CIBSE Guide G (2004).",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Cold Water Dwellings - Storage Capacities\n\nThis tool calculates storage requirements for cold water systems in dwellings based on fixtures and building types.\n\n**Key Guidelines:**\n- A water storage in a domestic dwelling should have a capacity of at least 200-300 liters\n- Calculations based on CIBSE Guide G (2004) Public Health Engineering"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "basin_count",
          "label": "Number of Basins",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "bath_count",
          "label": "Number of Baths",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "garden_tap_count",
          "label": "Number of Garden Watering Taps",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "shower_count",
          "label": "Number of Showers",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "sink_count",
          "label": "Number of Sinks",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "urinal_count",
          "label": "Number of Urinals",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        },
        {
          "id": "wc_count",
          "label": "Number of WCs",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "fixtures"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "basin_capacity",
          "label": "Basin Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.basin_count * 90",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "bath_capacity",
          "label": "Bath Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.bath_count * 900",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "garden_tap_capacity",
          "label": "Garden Tap Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.garden_tap_count * 180",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "shower_capacity",
          "label": "Shower Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.shower_count * 185",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "sink_capacity",
          "label": "Sink Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.sink_count * 135",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "urinal_capacity",
          "label": "Urinal Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.urinal_count * 110",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "wc_capacity",
          "label": "WC Storage Requirement",
          "formula": "inputs.wc_count * 180",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_capacity",
          "label": "Total Storage Capacity Required",
          "formula": "inputs.basin_count * 90 + inputs.bath_count * 900 + inputs.garden_tap_count * 180 + inputs.shower_count * 185 + inputs.sink_count * 135 + inputs.urinal_count * 110 + inputs.wc_count * 180",
          "unit": "liters",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Type of Fixture",
        "Storage Capacity (liters)",
        "Storage Capacity (gal)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Basin",
          90,
          23
        ],
        [
          "Bath",
          900,
          207
        ],
        [
          "Garden watering tap",
          180,
          47
        ],
        [
          "Shower",
          "140 - 230",
          "36 - 60"
        ],
        [
          "Sink",
          "90 - 180",
          "23 - 47"
        ],
        [
          "Urinal",
          110,
          29
        ],
        [
          "WC",
          180,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Type of Building",
        "Storage per Person (liters)",
        "Storage per Person (gal)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Hostels",
          90,
          23
        ],
        [
          "Hotels",
          135,
          35
        ],
        [
          "Offices with canteens",
          45,
          12
        ],
        [
          "Offices without canteens",
          40,
          10
        ],
        [
          "Restaurants, per meal",
          7,
          2
        ],
        [
          "Boarding School",
          90,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Reference\n\n- **Source:** CIBSE Guide G (2004) Public Health Engineering\n- **Domestic Dwelling Standard:** A water storage in a domestic dwelling should have a capacity of at least 200-300 liters"
    }
  ]
}